        "Hard-capped at 4 discrete iterations — no infinite agent loops, zero open-ended recursion",
        "Sub-50ms CPU execution time measured end-to-end within AgenticController",
        "Graceful degradation: fallback scoring ensures search results return even if graph expansion is sparse",
        "Rich agent_trace[] emitted with every execution for full debugging and explainability"
      ]
